From 1bfc3b4dd3aafb6b3d2caa75b919533275e4ecac Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: sfxnz <sfxnz@spark1.tail1a9513.ts.net>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 12:32:19 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] inkling2: pack NVFP4 experts into BLOCK4 with fused softcap
 SwiGLU and sm_121a TC prefill

Load-time GPU repack of Inkling 2 Mini NVFP4 routed experts (L0-19, 44/48 visits) into Nvfp4Experts BLOCK4 layout directly inside the existing weight arena (zero extra steady-state VRAM; reusable 382 MB staging buffer freed before KV pool sizing).

Decode/verify (M=1..31):
- Fused gate+up+softcap-SwiGLU in nvfp4_experts.cu (GB10 sm_121 register-ring ld_nc + fp4pair + post-MMA group scale + post-K outer scale), eliminating b.gate, b.up, and 44 tf_ink2moe_act launches per round.
- Split-half 16-col/warp (tf_nvfp4_softcap_half) for low-row saturation at c1 and HW-scheduled 32-col/warp CTAs (or equal-waves via TF_INKLING2_MOE_WAVES=1) for c4 diverged M=4..31, with bit-exact BF16 intermediate rounding (negative up_cap) and ascending-expert combine.
- Selectable via TF_INKLING2_FAST_MOE=1 (default ON; 0 keeps raw ModelOpt path for same-binary A/B).

Prefill (M>=32):
- Build nvfp4_experts with arch_specific=true (sm_121a) and wire fused tf_nvfp4_prompt_softcap_tc_q + tf_nvfp4_prompt_down_tc_q (4-stage 46 KiB SMEM pipeline, mma.mxf4nvf4, dynamic NT row-tile skipping) directly over packed BLOCK4 weights, plus BF16 MMA fallback (tf_nvfp4_prompt_softcap + tf_nvfp4_prompt_down) when PREFILL_TC=0.

Credits:
- Adapted from MiaAI-Lab (commit 9e3cf20b, patches/0007-mini-expert-split.patch and patches/0015-mini-prefill-tc.patch, Apache-2.0/MIT) and upstream TensorFold PR #4441 Nvfp4Experts integration.
